              <h2 id="settings-interface-heading">界面</h2>
            </header>

            <p class="card-lede">调整外观与对话阅读密度，改动会立即生效。</p>

            <div class="pref-row">
              <div class="pref-copy">
                <span class="pref-name">主题</span>
                <span class="pref-hint">切换浅色或深色外观。</span>
              </div>
              <div class="segmented" role="group" aria-label="主题">
                <button
